      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this is important as to state as neuturally as possible there are users who dont want to support AI, and there are some who do. To give each type of community member the ability to sort that for themselves would be a huge benefit. \n\nI would even be fine with OPs suggestions of being able to filter it out to not be there as incase VRChat also feels like it could create bias. But as long as I know what has been used before going into world and report worlds that are clearly inaccurate I would be onboard.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
